      "message": "Done. Added self.process.wait() after self.process.kill() in Renode.cleanup(). Also removed explicit self._temp_dir.cleanup() from cleanup(), relying on tempfile.TemporaryDirectory automatic cleanup on process exit so _temp_dir remains active across all test runs on the board.",
